{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 pool building (random towns, commercial lots): a two-storey-high grocery hall with a mezzanine office. Route: the front doors are chained, carts piled behind them -> round the back past Northline's reefer trailer (a trap under its doors) -> the pried roll-up door into receiving -> the stock room -> swing doors onto the floor (Sal stands behind the butcher's counter, held) -> the aisles are a maze of collapsed shelving: only aisle 2 is clear, and cans are strung across it (the shoppers rise) -> the meat room behind the counter (opening its door wakes Sal) -> the walk-in is padlocked and wired with a battery alarm -> back to receiving and up to the mezzanine: Ruth's office and the key -> drop through the broken railing onto the floor -> the walk-in (loot; Danny guards it) -> out by the meat room's bolted back door. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
